    "created_at": "2020-09-11T21:23:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-11T21:24:44Z",
    "body": "I think the word \"deprecated\"ᅟ in general means the feature will actually disappear in any near future. Since many of (if not all) historical features can't be removed anytime soon, I would prefer `[Historical]` here to prevent confusion.\r\n\r\n(It's also the word web specifications currently are using.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
