    "created_at": "2020-09-12T00:19:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-12T00:22:08Z",
    "body": "The Legacy prefix sounds like the extended attribute itself shouldn't be used anymore. Some APIs may still become \"historical\" as the web changes, and we'll want to add `[Historical]` to them. So `[LegacyHistorical]` sounds a bit confusing to me.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
