    "created_at": "2020-09-12T00:36:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-12T00:36:08Z",
    "body": "> What about naming it just `[Legacy]` then?\r\n\r\nIMO it's weird when others use it as a prefix. Do you have a reason not to use Historical? I think it's not rare, with some existing examples:\r\n\r\n* DOM https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-event\r\n* Fullscreen https://fullscreen.spec.whatwg.org/#api\r\n* CSSOM https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom/#the-cssrule-interface\r\n",
